===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl=catfish|pl2=catfishes}}

# Any fish of the order ''[[Siluriformes]]'', that are mainly found in [[freshwater]], are without [[scale]]s, and have [[barbel]]s like [[whisker]]s around the mouth.
# Any fictional fish whose [[face]] is of a [[cat]].

